(2307795, 319594, 31133, '<td valign="top">The longer I look at this, the more I like it. The lighting is really cool. I just wish that big thumb wasn''t in the lower left. It frustrates me in a way, because I love the rest of the image.</td>', 'The longer I look at this, the more I like it. The lighting is really cool. I just wish that big thumb wasn''t in the lower left. It frustrates me in a way, because I love the rest of the image.', '2006-04-12 17:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2307805, 318420, 31133, '<td valign="top">Nice colors in the upper right! I think this would be nice without the goblet on the left ... the keys and whatever it is they''re attached to look like enough for the frame.</td>', 'Nice colors in the upper right! I think this would be nice without the goblet on the left ... the keys and whatever it is they''re attached to look like enough for the frame.', '2006-04-12 17:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
