(2307824, 319574, 31133, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. I have no idea what this is, but the image is captivating and fine.</td>', 'Beautiful. I have no idea what this is, but the image is captivating and fine.', '2006-04-12 17:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2307836, 318215, 31133, '<td valign="top">What a car! The sky is beautiful, too. The ground competes a little with the car, but don''t have any good suggestion about what might be improved ... yes, maybe if it were possible to either haave a tighter crop (but then you wouldn''t get the whole car in maybe) or to have a shallow dof, so just the car was in sharp focus. The direction of the shot is great! I like how the car is heading away from the viewer.</td>', 'What a car! The sky is beautiful, too. The ground competes a little with the car, but don''t have any good suggestion about what might be improved ... yes, maybe if it were possible to either haave a tighter crop (but then you wouldn''t get the whole car in maybe) or to have a shallow dof, so just the car was in sharp focus. The direction of the shot is great! I like how the car is heading away from the viewer.', '2006-04-12 18:01:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2307840, 319348, 33515, '<td valign="top">Kind of small, really need to hit the max 640px. Check out the tutorial on resizing</td>', 'Kind of small, really need to hit the max 640px. Check out the tutorial on resizing', '2006-04-12 18:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2307841, 320058, 31133, '<td valign="top">A bit grainy and out of focus. I am curious what this is - it does look like chrome to me, though so that''s good. Otherwise, I''m unfortunately not giving this a very high score because of the technical and composition issues. Keep working at it, though!!</td>', 'A bit grainy and out of focus. I am curious what this is - it does look like chrome to me, though so that''s good. Otherwise, I''m unfortunately not giving this a very high score because of the technical and composition issues. Keep working at it, though!!', '2006-04-12 18:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
