(2307844, 318129, 33515, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of chrome on this bike. It may have been better to include the whole thing, otherwise it is difficult to figure out what you are seeing..</td>', 'There is a lot of chrome on this bike. It may have been better to include the whole thing, otherwise it is difficult to figure out what you are seeing..', '2006-04-12 18:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2307848, 319598, 31133, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge well, but unfortunately, the composition confuses me. I''m not sure what you intend the viewer to focus on, where my eye should rest. I think this might be cool if it were just the spoon and fork shown on the left and not the bunch of spoons on the right - they have the photographer''s reflection in them. The grain is also an issue for me.</td>', 'Meets the challenge well, but unfortunately, the composition confuses me. I''m not sure what you intend the viewer to focus on, where my eye should rest. I think this might be cool if it were just the spoon and fork shown on the left and not the bunch of spoons on the right - they have the photographer''s reflection in them. The grain is also an issue for me.', '2006-04-12 18:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2307851, 320047, 31133, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!!! I love the colors here - and what a creative entry this is! I hope you leave some notes in the photographer''s thingie so we can see what you did here. This is inspiring.</td>', 'Wonderful!!! I love the colors here - and what a creative entry this is! I hope you leave some notes in the photographer''s thingie so we can see what you did here. This is inspiring.', '2006-04-12 18:09:36.000000', NULL, 1),
