(2307872, 318838, 31133, '<td valign="top">There''s a little too much for me to look at here - I wish it were either just the grate or just the light - or that the crop wasn''t so tight, so one could get a little better perspective. The black and white treatment is appealing though, and the contrast seems perfect.</td>', 'There''s a little too much for me to look at here - I wish it were either just the grate or just the light - or that the crop wasn''t so tight, so one could get a little better perspective. The black and white treatment is appealing though, and the contrast seems perfect.', '2006-04-12 18:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
