(2308991, 319018, 17203, '<td valign="top">Ya know, normally toys used as props get killed in the challenges, but I have to give you credit for making the car look believable. The texture of the rusty surface and the obscure background make the car seem almost real (if not for your title and that stray hair on the fender). Aside from that, you haven''t really given your subject a story- a reason for being- so it''s just, well... there. The words "aluminum" probably won''t help you either, but again- good job making a toy look real! 6</td>', 'Ya know, normally toys used as props get killed in the challenges, but I have to give you credit for making the car look believable. The texture of the rusty surface and the obscure background make the car seem almost real (if not for your title and that stray hair on the fender). Aside from that, you haven''t really given your subject a story- a reason for being- so it''s just, well... there. The words "aluminum" probably won''t help you either, but again- good job making a toy look real! 6', '2006-04-13 00:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2308992, 319789, 24454, '<td valign="top">Very striking!!!   Clean, sharp. perfectly exposed.  Yep.  I really love this one!!!</td>', 'Very striking!!!   Clean, sharp. perfectly exposed.  Yep.  I really love this one!!!', '2006-04-13 00:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
