(2309415, 317691, 56754, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but the execution could have been better; your "element" looks white rather than chrome, and the cut off black logo at the bottom seems a bit distracting.</td>', 'Good idea, but the execution could have been better; your "element" looks white rather than chrome, and the cut off black logo at the bottom seems a bit distracting.', '2006-04-13 06:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
