(2309419, 319789, 56754, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, and good framing.  If I had to guess (if this is your car), would it be an X type?</td>', 'Neat idea, and good framing.  If I had to guess (if this is your car), would it be an X type?', '2006-04-13 06:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
