(2309725, 319661, 42100, '<td valign="top">Creative idea, the composition and DOF makes for an interesting photo.  Well done!</td>', 'Creative idea, the composition and DOF makes for an interesting photo.  Well done!', '2006-04-13 10:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309816, 318485, 18799, '<td valign="top">A good effort.  The devil being in the details, for a product shot, you have to eliminate the hot spots from the lighting and polish the components.  5</td>', 'A good effort.  The devil being in the details, for a product shot, you have to eliminate the hot spots from the lighting and polish the components.  5', '2006-04-13 11:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309825, 318601, 18799, '<td valign="top">The chipped tile and the scratched utensiles are distractions.  It also appears to be tilted a little to the left.  5</td>', 'The chipped tile and the scratched utensiles are distractions.  It also appears to be tilted a little to the left.  5', '2006-04-13 11:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309835, 319100, 18799, '<td valign="top">It would have been nice if you could have pulled it away from the background a little more to reduce/eliminate that harsh shadow.  The scratches/reflections on the top pieces are a bit of a distraction too.  5</td>', 'It would have been nice if you could have pulled it away from the background a little more to reduce/eliminate that harsh shadow.  The scratches/reflections on the top pieces are a bit of a distraction too.  5', '2006-04-13 11:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309837, 318297, 18799, '<td valign="top">The water makes it look a little messy to me.  5</td>', 'The water makes it look a little messy to me.  5', '2006-04-13 11:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309841, 318838, 18799, '<td valign="top">It appears that the headlight is pretty much in focus, but the grill is soft.  I think a major component of the image such as the grill should be sharp.  5</td>', 'It appears that the headlight is pretty much in focus, but the grill is soft.  I think a major component of the image such as the grill should be sharp.  5', '2006-04-13 11:30:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309843, 318987, 18799, '<td valign="top">Hard to look at, there is no focal point.</td>', 'Hard to look at, there is no focal point.', '2006-04-13 11:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309851, 317533, 18799, '<td valign="top">It took me a second to figure out those are stone in the background - at first glance, I thought they were potatoes LOL.  I like the lure, but I think the background is to close/infocus so the lure doesn''t stand out as well as it could have.  I think you could have found a more dynamic angle to shoot from to give it a WOW factor.  5</td>', 'It took me a second to figure out those are stone in the background - at first glance, I thought they were potatoes LOL.  I like the lure, but I think the background is to close/infocus so the lure doesn''t stand out as well as it could have.  I think you could have found a more dynamic angle to shoot from to give it a WOW factor.  5', '2006-04-13 11:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309905, 318215, 42100, '<td valign="top">There''s a beauty that deserves a resurection.  I like how you composed the car in such a way as to create leading lines.  With all that rust and texture this would look great in the warmer light of early morning or late afternoon.  Very nice!</td>', 'There''s a beauty that deserves a resurection.  I like how you composed the car in such a way as to create leading lines.  With all that rust and texture this would look great in the warmer light of early morning or late afternoon.  Very nice!', '2006-04-13 12:07:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2309916, 318715, 42100, '<td valign="top">I really like the in your face composition of this desert jewel.  The light and shadow seems a little harsh and maybe even a tad oversautrated for my tastes.</td>', 'I really like the in your face composition of this desert jewel.  The light and shadow seems a little harsh and maybe even a tad oversautrated for my tastes.', '2006-04-13 12:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
