(2310534, 318601, 32644, '<td valign="top">This looks like it would be a good photo except for the seam and the chip.<br/>The colors are great.</td>', 'This looks like it would be a good photo except for the seam and the chip.The colors are great.', '2006-04-13 17:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
