(2310785, 318308, 51802, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what I can offer to help this picture out.  I can''t tell what I am looking at.  It could be chrome, but it looks more like an out of focus water spray.  Maybe if the shot were taken from further away it would give more perspective.</td>', 'Don''t know what I can offer to help this picture out.  I can''t tell what I am looking at.  It could be chrome, but it looks more like an out of focus water spray.  Maybe if the shot were taken from further away it would give more perspective.', '2006-04-13 19:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
