(2311710, 319159, 52908, '<td valign="top">Good shot. It''s a bit hot towards the upper right corner. Maybe trying to expose for the harsh highlights, rather than the mid-tones would have gotten the point across a little better? Nice concept though, there''s lots of chrome there, for sure.</td>', 'Good shot. It''s a bit hot towards the upper right corner. Maybe trying to expose for the harsh highlights, rather than the mid-tones would have gotten the point across a little better? Nice concept though, there''s lots of chrome there, for sure.', '2006-04-14 03:54:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2311720, 316960, 42984, '<td valign="top">Love the sculture (which is bronxe) so you''re going to bomb in this challenge - it doesn''t deserve that.  One thing to look out for is the background. You don''t need it in this shot so if you can change your aperture somehow down to 2.8 or as low as it goes, that shortens the depth of field and makes the background all out of focus</td>', 'Love the sculture (which is bronxe) so you''re going to bomb in this challenge - it doesn''t deserve that.  One thing to look out for is the background. You don''t need it in this shot so if you can change your aperture somehow down to 2.8 or as low as it goes, that shortens the depth of field and makes the background all out of focus', '2006-04-14 04:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2311755, 319691, 51533, '<td valign="top">Nicely done! I had a similar idea (while searching through the house for possible chrome candidates...) but finally decided on other idea (mainly as I was out of pasta... :) )</td>', 'Nicely done! I had a similar idea (while searching through the house for possible chrome candidates...) but finally decided on other idea (mainly as I was out of pasta... :) )', '2006-04-14 04:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2311762, 317861, 51533, '<td valign="top">You must be the one that posted "jump" in the wrong challenge :) interesting angle, only a bit dark and the background not clear: is it dark sky? also it seems hard to make out the details in the face and hand;</td>', 'You must be the one that posted "jump" in the wrong challenge :) interesting angle, only a bit dark and the background not clear: is it dark sky? also it seems hard to make out the details in the face and hand;', '2006-04-14 05:07:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312188, 319726, 37719, '<td valign="top">hmm... I think these are more properly called ''standpipes'' not hydrants.</td>', 'hmm... I think these are more properly called ''standpipes'' not hydrants.', '2006-04-14 11:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
