(2312256, 319773, 52285, '<td valign="top">This one is absolutely brilliant. I wonder how you avoided the shadow of the tap to be distorted by the curvature of the sink ... I guess the tap was not fitted on a sink, isn''t it?</td>', 'This one is absolutely brilliant. I wonder how you avoided the shadow of the tap to be distorted by the curvature of the sink ... I guess the tap was not fitted on a sink, isn''t it?', '2006-04-14 12:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312305, 319407, 54044, '<td valign="top">very nice shot ,but it looks a tiny bit fuzzy</td>', 'very nice shot ,but it looks a tiny bit fuzzy', '2006-04-14 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312315, 318322, 54044, '<td valign="top">nice idea ,shame about the reflection of your camera</td>', 'nice idea ,shame about the reflection of your camera', '2006-04-14 12:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312810, 319159, 55957, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a little too busy. It''s too much to take in, and that big patch of over-exposed white in the top left is really distracting. I think it would be better if you took a tighter crop to give it more focus. I like the colours, though. It''s a great contrast between the masses of blue, and the little red thingies. (not a car guy, sorry, don''t know the names for them.)</td>', 'I think it''s a little too busy. It''s too much to take in, and that big patch of over-exposed white in the top left is really distracting. I think it would be better if you took a tighter crop to give it more focus. I like the colours, though. It''s a great contrast between the masses of blue, and the little red thingies. (not a car guy, sorry, don''t know the names for them.)', '2006-04-14 17:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312813, 318071, 55957, '<td valign="top">Plain and simple. I like it. :D</td>', 'Plain and simple. I like it. :D', '2006-04-14 17:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312816, 317979, 55957, '<td valign="top">I like the concept here, but I think you should have chosen a dark background. The chrome of the thing blends into the BG too much. Other than that, it''s really good.</td>', 'I like the concept here, but I think you should have chosen a dark background. The chrome of the thing blends into the BG too much. Other than that, it''s really good.', '2006-04-14 17:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312822, 318389, 55957, '<td valign="top">I like the visible reflection, and the candles are a nice touch, but I would like it more if the focus were on the faucet.</td>', 'I like the visible reflection, and the candles are a nice touch, but I would like it more if the focus were on the faucet.', '2006-04-14 17:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312827, 317851, 55957, '<td valign="top">Certainly a unique interpretation. :D</td>', 'Certainly a unique interpretation. :D', '2006-04-14 17:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312835, 318322, 55957, '<td valign="top">I really like the background, it was a good choice. The straight lines of the cloth are nice in contrast with the round balls.</td>', 'I really like the background, it was a good choice. The straight lines of the cloth are nice in contrast with the round balls.', '2006-04-14 17:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312843, 319691, 55957, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast between the colour and the chrome.</td>', 'Nice contrast between the colour and the chrome.', '2006-04-14 17:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312847, 319989, 55957, '<td valign="top">I like this. It feels very clean.</td>', 'I like this. It feels very clean.', '2006-04-14 17:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312850, 318262, 55957, '<td valign="top">Nice concept. I''m assuming that''s a wedding band?</td>', 'Nice concept. I''m assuming that''s a wedding band?', '2006-04-14 17:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312858, 320024, 55957, '<td valign="top">The title makes me giggle. :) good contrast. Despite the fact that it''s a fairly low-contrast piece, the legs don''t get lost in the floor, and I suspect that any more contrast and it would hurt the eyes. Good job, overall. Oh, and the texture of the floor tiles makes a nice contrast with the smoothness of the legs. :)</td>', 'The title makes me giggle. :) good contrast. Despite the fact that it''s a fairly low-contrast piece, the legs don''t get lost in the floor, and I suspect that any more contrast and it would hurt the eyes. Good job, overall. Oh, and the texture of the floor tiles makes a nice contrast with the smoothness of the legs. :)', '2006-04-14 18:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312861, 319634, 55957, '<td valign="top">I find the purple colour cast distracting. Other than that, it''s pretty solid.</td>', 'I find the purple colour cast distracting. Other than that, it''s pretty solid.', '2006-04-14 18:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312867, 318675, 55957, '<td valign="top">For some reason, I find the stuff in the background more interesting than the bottle itself.</td>', 'For some reason, I find the stuff in the background more interesting than the bottle itself.', '2006-04-14 18:03:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312876, 319514, 55957, '<td valign="top">This feels like it should be in a brochure. Really good composition/crop. I would have been tempted to center it in a wider frame, but I''m a fool for symmetry. This way it''s a lot stronger, and leaves some to the imagination. Good job! :)</td>', 'This feels like it should be in a brochure. Really good composition/crop. I would have been tempted to center it in a wider frame, but I''m a fool for symmetry. This way it''s a lot stronger, and leaves some to the imagination. Good job! :)', '2006-04-14 18:06:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312884, 319773, 55957, '<td valign="top">It really does kinda look like a gecko. Good jorb. :D</td>', 'It really does kinda look like a gecko. Good jorb. :D', '2006-04-14 18:08:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312896, 319981, 55957, '<td valign="top">Great feeling of motion, but i think it might have been stronger if you tilted it so the water droplets fell behind the squirter, leaving an un-obstructed view of the squirter itself. But then again, that might have looked weird. *shrug* either way, I like it. :D</td>', 'Great feeling of motion, but i think it might have been stronger if you tilted it so the water droplets fell behind the squirter, leaving an un-obstructed view of the squirter itself. But then again, that might have looked weird. *shrug* either way, I like it. :D', '2006-04-14 18:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312900, 319483, 55957, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept, and good choice of background.</td>', 'Interesting concept, and good choice of background.', '2006-04-14 18:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312905, 318420, 55957, '<td valign="top">The red and blue lights in the handcuffs are a really subtle touch. good job.</td>', 'The red and blue lights in the handcuffs are a really subtle touch. good job.', '2006-04-14 18:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312908, 318485, 55957, '<td valign="top">NOOO! Don''t smash the poor ipod! It doesn''t know any better! *giggle*<br/>Cute concept, and good composition. Could be a little sharper.</td>', 'NOOO! Don''t smash the poor ipod! It doesn''t know any better! *giggle*Cute concept, and good composition. Could be a little sharper.', '2006-04-14 18:21:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312911, 318671, 55957, '<td valign="top">Scary. I''ll never look at forks the same way again. Excellent focus and contrast.</td>', 'Scary. I''ll never look at forks the same way again. Excellent focus and contrast.', '2006-04-14 18:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2312914, 319281, 55957, '<td valign="top">I almost think this would be better without the guy on the stairs. The distortion is weird, and he takes the focus away from the angle of the stairs, which I think is more important to the photo. Despite this, his expression is great, and you''ve got the perspective and composition of the stairs dead-on.</td>', 'I almost think this would be better without the guy on the stairs. The distortion is weird, and he takes the focus away from the angle of the stairs, which I think is more important to the photo. Despite this, his expression is great, and you''ve got the perspective and composition of the stairs dead-on.', '2006-04-14 18:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(2313013, 317861, 44980, '<td valign="top">Wrong challenge, I''m afraid. Pity because that''s a good jump!</td>', 'Wrong challenge, I''m afraid. Pity because that''s a good jump!', '2006-04-14 19:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2313073, 319796, 46097, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been stronger without the background object. Also seems slightly oversharpened.</td>', 'I think this would have been stronger without the background object. Also seems slightly oversharpened.', '2006-04-14 20:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
