(2315943, 319100, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5 <br/>Color/lighting=0 <br/>DOF/focus=0 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=1 <br/> <br/>cool object.  I feel the lighting at the top could have probably been a little better so that more of that was visable, the darks seem to be too dark (if that''s possible).  Also, maybe cropped it a little different to avoid cutting off the top, hose and bottom with the border.  If more of the bottom and maybe hose section had been cropped it would probably be fine but the little bit makes it appear that you could careless or just didn''t take the time.  I feel the top really needs the entire part in it.</td>', 'Fits challenge=5 Color/lighting=0 DOF/focus=0 Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=1  cool object.  I feel the lighting at the top could have probably been a little better so that more of that was visable, the darks seem to be too dark (if that''s possible).  Also, maybe cropped it a little different to avoid cutting off the top, hose and bottom with the border.  If more of the bottom and maybe hose section had been cropped it would probably be fine but the little bit makes it appear that you could careless or just didn''t take the time.  I feel the top really needs the entire part in it.', '2006-04-16 13:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2315944, 319604, 40133, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but IMHO this one should have a bit more contrast - or go low key.</td>', 'Nice shot, but IMHO this one should have a bit more contrast - or go low key.', '2006-04-16 13:10:08.000000', NULL, 1),
