(2315947, 319801, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5 <br/>Color/lighting=1 <br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=1 <br/>Attractiveness=0 <br/> <br/>I like the image a lot but feel that it would have been better with just the pots and lids. I find the thing on the left very distracting.  I think you had a good object but went just a little too far with it.  I like the placement colors and even simple border but can''t get past the thing on the left.</td>', 'Fits challenge=5 Color/lighting=1 DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=1 Attractiveness=0  I like the image a lot but feel that it would have been better with just the pots and lids. I find the thing on the left very distracting.  I think you had a good object but went just a little too far with it.  I like the placement colors and even simple border but can''t get past the thing on the left.', '2006-04-16 13:12:29.000000', NULL, 1),
