(2316021, 319099, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5 <br/>Color/lighting=1 <br/>DOF/focus=0 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=1 <br/> <br/>Wow, looks like this one has seen some years and mileage.  gonna have to check back for it''s location, I get the feeling of some old Italian town or something similar.<br/> <br/>I like the angle you shot this at and placement in the frame but keep questioning the redish tone.  While this adds to the tone of the image and helps show its age I can''t help but wonder if something different would be better...I''m probably way off key.  I also wonder if a different depth of field would help the image any.</td>', 'Fits challenge=5 Color/lighting=1 DOF/focus=0 Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=1  Wow, looks like this one has seen some years and mileage.  gonna have to check back for it''s location, I get the feeling of some old Italian town or something similar. I like the angle you shot this at and placement in the frame but keep questioning the redish tone.  While this adds to the tone of the image and helps show its age I can''t help but wonder if something different would be better...I''m probably way off key.  I also wonder if a different depth of field would help the image any.', '2006-04-16 14:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
