(2316211, 318389, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5 <br/>Color/lighting=1 <br/>DOF/focus=0 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=0 <br/> <br/>I have a problem looking at this, the faucet wants to be the main focus because of it position and size.  But because of your depth of field, the main focus is on the candles and the faucet gets in the way.  The lighting seems appropriate for the candles and the reflection in the faucet is interesting but too out of focus to add impact.  Maybe an angle where you were more in front of the faucet would help move it out of the main line of sight if in fact you wanted more focus on the candles.</td>', 'Fits challenge=5 Color/lighting=1 DOF/focus=0 Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=0  I have a problem looking at this, the faucet wants to be the main focus because of it position and size.  But because of your depth of field, the main focus is on the candles and the faucet gets in the way.  The lighting seems appropriate for the candles and the reflection in the faucet is interesting but too out of focus to add impact.  Maybe an angle where you were more in front of the faucet would help move it out of the main line of sight if in fact you wanted more focus on the candles.', '2006-04-16 15:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2316219, 319995, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5 <br/>Color/lighting=0 <br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=0 <br/> <br/>Interesting, the greys seem a little muddy, maybe a little boost in contrast could help that and help see a little more around the center ball.  The ball is nicely framed and has good detail...actually probably a bit too much considering how scratched it is.  A nice clean crisp one would be preferred.</td>', 'Fits challenge=5 Color/lighting=0 DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=0  Interesting, the greys seem a little muddy, maybe a little boost in contrast could help that and help see a little more around the center ball.  The ball is nicely framed and has good detail...actually probably a bit too much considering how scratched it is.  A nice clean crisp one would be preferred.', '2006-04-16 15:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
