(2319149, 319777, 39349, '<td valign="top">Interesting, I like your idea, perhaps a different angle would improve this shot. Like shooting from the ground up to make the ice cream chrome look like it''s sprouting out of the ground? Hot spot on the chrome ball is distracting and the dead leaves seem to clutter up the shot. A few tweaks and you''ll have a winner IMHO.</td>', 'Interesting, I like your idea, perhaps a different angle would improve this shot. Like shooting from the ground up to make the ice cream chrome look like it''s sprouting out of the ground? Hot spot on the chrome ball is distracting and the dead leaves seem to clutter up the shot. A few tweaks and you''ll have a winner IMHO.', '2006-04-17 13:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319161, 319606, 39349, '<td valign="top">You captured some good mechanical components here but this feels very much a snapshot. The blown out highlights on the distributor and headers distract my attention too much. Plus there is no real focal point to this shot, where should my attention be draw to? I do like the bluing of the headers, some different angles / lighting and you''ll have some good stuff I think.</td>', 'You captured some good mechanical components here but this feels very much a snapshot. The blown out highlights on the distributor and headers distract my attention too much. Plus there is no real focal point to this shot, where should my attention be draw to? I do like the bluing of the headers, some different angles / lighting and you''ll have some good stuff I think.', '2006-04-17 13:58:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319168, 317194, 39349, '<td valign="top">Nice clean chrome cup! Seems a bit out of focus and tilted to the left. If possible use a tripod next time and level it out and you''ll have a tack sharp image with WOW factor.</td>', 'Nice clean chrome cup! Seems a bit out of focus and tilted to the left. If possible use a tripod next time and level it out and you''ll have a tack sharp image with WOW factor.', '2006-04-17 14:00:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319171, 317533, 39349, '<td valign="top">WOW! Tack sharp image with interest and now I want to break out the rod and reel, THANKS! I give this a 10.</td>', 'WOW! Tack sharp image with interest and now I want to break out the rod and reel, THANKS! I give this a 10.', '2006-04-17 14:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319177, 319787, 39349, '<td valign="top">Perfect mirror finish! I think if you cropped off the left 3rd of the shot you would remove the distracting downward lines that my eye keeps being drawn to.</td>', 'Perfect mirror finish! I think if you cropped off the left 3rd of the shot you would remove the distracting downward lines that my eye keeps being drawn to.', '2006-04-17 14:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319181, 318541, 39349, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture. Nothing I would change except to put it in a HD catalog.</td>', 'Very nice capture. Nothing I would change except to put it in a HD catalog.', '2006-04-17 14:05:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319182, 319661, 39349, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective. I like your choice of DOF.</td>', 'Interesting perspective. I like your choice of DOF.', '2006-04-17 14:05:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319183, 319310, 39349, '<td valign="top">WOW! Colors just jump off my screen. Well done!</td>', 'WOW! Colors just jump off my screen. Well done!', '2006-04-17 14:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319191, 319407, 39349, '<td valign="top">Hum....good idea, clean chrome but perhaps a bit too much USM? Tone it down a bit and you''ll have a great shot here.</td>', 'Hum....good idea, clean chrome but perhaps a bit too much USM? Tone it down a bit and you''ll have a great shot here.', '2006-04-17 14:10:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319197, 319894, 39349, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture. One of another fishing shots in this challenge. You have a wonderful shot here that really needs no changes. Great composition DOF and tack sharp focus make this a winner IMHO.</td>', 'Beautiful capture. One of another fishing shots in this challenge. You have a wonderful shot here that really needs no changes. Great composition DOF and tack sharp focus make this a winner IMHO.', '2006-04-17 14:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319241, 319748, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5 <br/>Color/lighting=1 <br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=0 <br/>Attractiveness=0 <br/> <br/>I like small amount of color and your depth of field is nice.<br/> <br/>I don''t mark down for it but I do think I should mention that you may have a problem with compression.  To the right of the subject you can see color bleeding and jpg artifacts.  I usually check my monitor if I see a lot of these but your''s is the first image I''ve found it on.  If you compressed too much to fit the submission requirements this will happen.  You may only be able to see it if you crank up your brightness or contrast on your monitor.  It doesn''t hurt the main subject but can detour from the quality of it.<br/> <br/> <br/>edit 17Apr...took another look at your image, while I do see the jpg noise or artifacts I think the red color banding I saw may just be reflections so it may not be as serious a problem as I had thought.</td>', 'Fits challenge=5 Color/lighting=1 DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=0 Attractiveness=0  I like small amount of color and your depth of field is nice. I don''t mark down for it but I do think I should mention that you may have a problem with compression.  To the right of the subject you can see color bleeding and jpg artifacts.  I usually check my monitor if I see a lot of these but your''s is the first image I''ve found it on.  If you compressed too much to fit the submission requirements this will happen.  You may only be able to see it if you crank up your brightness or contrast on your monitor.  It doesn''t hurt the main subject but can detour from the quality of it.  edit 17Apr...took another look at your image, while I do see the jpg noise or artifacts I think the red color banding I saw may just be reflections so it may not be as serious a problem as I had thought.', '2006-04-17 14:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319244, 318043, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5 <br/>Color/lighting=1 <br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=1 <br/>Attractiveness=1 <br/> <br/>wow this one''s seen some rough times (pun on purpose) huh.  Nicely done.  I like the subtle hints of color (I wonder if you could desat the green to make it only have the red).  Image is slightly smaller than the normal submission but not on a scale that hurts it really.</td>', 'Fits challenge=5 Color/lighting=1 DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=1 Attractiveness=1  wow this one''s seen some rough times (pun on purpose) huh.  Nicely done.  I like the subtle hints of color (I wonder if you could desat the green to make it only have the red).  Image is slightly smaller than the normal submission but not on a scale that hurts it really.', '2006-04-17 14:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2319248, 319561, 25095, '<td valign="top">Fits challenge=5 <br/>Color/lighting=1 <br/>DOF/focus=1 <br/>Wow factor/uniqueness=1 <br/>Attractiveness=1 <br/> <br/>Cool!  I like the placement and idea but have a few suggestions.  You can see water spots in the logo, maybe could be dried more to get it cleaner.  I wonder what it would look like if you desaturate the blue only and make the chrome really pop while still keeping the other colors...just a thought, already a cool image.</td>', 'Fits challenge=5 Color/lighting=1 DOF/focus=1 Wow factor/uniqueness=1 Attractiveness=1  Cool!  I like the placement and idea but have a few suggestions.  You can see water spots in the logo, maybe could be dried more to get it cleaner.  I wonder what it would look like if you desaturate the blue only and make the chrome really pop while still keeping the other colors...just a thought, already a cool image.', '2006-04-17 14:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
