(2321492, 319580, 53964, '<td valign="top">I do like the composition and colour, just needs to "pop" a bit more. Greater contrast?</td>', 'I do like the composition and colour, just needs to "pop" a bit more. Greater contrast?', '2006-04-18 10:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
