(2321499, 319683, 4010, '<td valign="top">Great picture.  Very unique idea for chrome in this challenge.  Well done.</td>', 'Great picture.  Very unique idea for chrome in this challenge.  Well done.', '2006-04-18 10:17:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321501, 320047, 4010, '<td valign="top">Great picture.  Would be curious how you made this.  Was it done in water?</td>', 'Great picture.  Would be curious how you made this.  Was it done in water?', '2006-04-18 10:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321503, 319147, 4010, '<td valign="top">I like your use of reflection to add to the story of the main chrome subject.</td>', 'I like your use of reflection to add to the story of the main chrome subject.', '2006-04-18 10:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321505, 319777, 30637, '<td valign="top">Very original!</td>', 'Very original!', '2006-04-18 10:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321509, 319773, 56978, '<td valign="top">Excellent vision....destined to become a "why didn''t I think of that"...</td>', 'Excellent vision....destined to become a "why didn''t I think of that"...', '2006-04-18 10:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321511, 319423, 30637, '<td valign="top">Nice idea</td>', 'Nice idea', '2006-04-18 10:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321512, 317194, 53964, '<td valign="top">Having it centered makes for a rather uninteresting presentation, imo.</td>', 'Having it centered makes for a rather uninteresting presentation, imo.', '2006-04-18 10:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321514, 319507, 30637, '<td valign="top">Wow! Cool idea and pic, one of my favorites!</td>', 'Wow! Cool idea and pic, one of my favorites!', '2006-04-18 10:22:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321517, 317356, 56978, '<td valign="top">How did you take that with your finger off the shutter??</td>', 'How did you take that with your finger off the shutter??', '2006-04-18 10:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321523, 319110, 53964, '<td valign="top">I find the background a little busy. I like the cup and bowl, contrasts in colour and materials and would like the simplicity of just the two of them.</td>', 'I find the background a little busy. I like the cup and bowl, contrasts in colour and materials and would like the simplicity of just the two of them.', '2006-04-18 10:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321526, 318342, 30637, '<td valign="top">How did you do that? Reflection above has hands down, reflection below has hands up.</td>', 'How did you do that? Reflection above has hands down, reflection below has hands up.', '2006-04-18 10:27:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321529, 317198, 53964, '<td valign="top">Lol, is this a homage to the Easter bunny?</td>', 'Lol, is this a homage to the Easter bunny?', '2006-04-18 10:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321532, 319265, 4010, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but a little too grainy.  Maybe too high of an ISO.</td>', 'Interesting shot, but a little too grainy.  Maybe too high of an ISO.', '2006-04-18 10:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321534, 319572, 4010, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I am not sure the strange angle realy helps the image.  I do like that there is something going on in the reflection in the glass spilling over to the chrome.  I think using the reflective nature of the chrome realy makes a good chrome shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I am not sure the strange angle realy helps the image.  I do like that there is something going on in the reflection in the glass spilling over to the chrome.  I think using the reflective nature of the chrome realy makes a good chrome shot.', '2006-04-18 10:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321535, 319395, 4010, '<td valign="top">May have been better if there was more going on composition-wise in the reflection in the chrome.</td>', 'May have been better if there was more going on composition-wise in the reflection in the chrome.', '2006-04-18 10:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321536, 317861, 30637, '<td valign="top">Great shot, but I don''t understand the chrome part.</td>', 'Great shot, but I don''t understand the chrome part.', '2006-04-18 10:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321538, 320006, 30637, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept</td>', 'Interesting concept', '2006-04-18 10:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321539, 319748, 4010, '<td valign="top">I like your use of DOF and perspective in this shot.</td>', 'I like your use of DOF and perspective in this shot.', '2006-04-18 10:33:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321544, 319561, 4010, '<td valign="top">Would have liked this better if the reflection was more an aspect of the composition, and did not have the distracting elements of the lightposts and wires.</td>', 'Would have liked this better if the reflection was more an aspect of the composition, and did not have the distracting elements of the lightposts and wires.', '2006-04-18 10:34:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321545, 318129, 4010, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but a little to grainy and soft.  Maybe try a different ISO next time.</td>', 'Good shot, but a little to grainy and soft.  Maybe try a different ISO next time.', '2006-04-18 10:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321548, 318700, 4010, '<td valign="top">Creative shot, but the highlights seem to be a little blown out.  Try reducing the exposure next time.</td>', 'Creative shot, but the highlights seem to be a little blown out.  Try reducing the exposure next time.', '2006-04-18 10:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321549, 318592, 30637, '<td valign="top">What IS that?</td>', 'What IS that?', '2006-04-18 10:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321551, 318389, 4010, '<td valign="top">Not sure if this was intentional, but I do like that there are elements in the reflection in the chrome.  I would have like it more, however, if the elements furthered the story of the image.  Maybe, somehow, relating the hectic day that the candles and bath are releiving.</td>', 'Not sure if this was intentional, but I do like that there are elements in the reflection in the chrome.  I would have like it more, however, if the elements furthered the story of the image.  Maybe, somehow, relating the hectic day that the candles and bath are releiving.', '2006-04-18 10:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321552, 319521, 4010, '<td valign="top">Nice image when the clever title is included.  Not sure the image stands on its own, without the title though.</td>', 'Nice image when the clever title is included.  Not sure the image stands on its own, without the title though.', '2006-04-18 10:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321554, 318987, 4010, '<td valign="top">Very interesting paterns going on here.  Would have liked it more with a greater DOF.</td>', 'Very interesting paterns going on here.  Would have liked it more with a greater DOF.', '2006-04-18 10:39:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321558, 320058, 4010, '<td valign="top">I like you use of reflections.  Could have been better if it was less grainy.</td>', 'I like you use of reflections.  Could have been better if it was less grainy.', '2006-04-18 10:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2321561, 318715, 4010, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this shot.</td>', 'I love the colors in this shot.', '2006-04-18 10:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
