(2321659, 319834, 4010, '<td valign="top">Nice use of reflection to tell a story.  I think it would have been more in line with the challenge, though, if the reflection was in the chrome.</td>', 'Nice use of reflection to tell a story.  I think it would have been more in line with the challenge, though, if the reflection was in the chrome.', '2006-04-18 11:46:01.000000', NULL, 1),
