(2325195, 318592, 54228, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the great feedback, it was unexpected to say the least!!! In answer to your question xianart: This shot was taken lying in the middle of a circle of chrome painted poles made to look like mirrors in a place called "Anyang Art Park" about 1 hour out of Seoul in South Korea. Glad to hear people liked it. I will be posting a night shot of it on my website soon, please check out //www.taintedlife.com/albumscript/index.cgi</td>', 'Thanks for all the great feedback, it was unexpected to say the least!!! In answer to your question xianart: This shot was taken lying in the middle of a circle of chrome painted poles made to look like mirrors in a place called "Anyang Art Park" about 1 hour out of Seoul in South Korea. Glad to hear people liked it. I will be posting a night shot of it on my website soon, please check out //www.taintedlife.com/albumscript/index.cgi', '2006-04-19 09:54:01.000000', NULL, 0),
