(2326110, 318092, 30982, '<td valign="top">I see you got some good comments as far as the technical aspect of the picture - I do like your choice of subject matter for the challenge and I kinda like pictures on the darker rather than lighter side.  This is a very good entry for your first - welcome to the insanity - hope you keep it up!</td>', 'I see you got some good comments as far as the technical aspect of the picture - I do like your choice of subject matter for the challenge and I kinda like pictures on the darker rather than lighter side.  This is a very good entry for your first - welcome to the insanity - hope you keep it up!', '2006-04-19 14:57:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2326129, 320047, 5728, '<td valign="top">Proud of ya Shannon, way to go!</td>', 'Proud of ya Shannon, way to go!', '2006-04-19 15:02:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2326133, 319310, 5728, '<td valign="top">Complementary colors :) Congrats.</td>', 'Complementary colors :) Congrats.', '2006-04-19 15:03:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2326135, 319894, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good on ya Mike, a clean and simple shot.</td>', 'Good on ya Mike, a clean and simple shot.', '2006-04-19 15:05:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2326220, 319407, 30982, '<td valign="top">The reflection of the second bike and lack of other distracting reflections is what made this one stand out to me.  About the only thing I can offer to make the shot "better" is to try a little less sharpening.  Good job!</td>', 'The reflection of the second bike and lack of other distracting reflections is what made this one stand out to me.  About the only thing I can offer to make the shot "better" is to try a little less sharpening.  Good job!', '2006-04-19 15:36:37.000000', NULL, 0),
