(2326579, 319687, 25095, '<td valign="top">to everyone that doesn''t see the chrome...it''s a chrome gazing ball reflecting the ground.  Hope the dnmc people didn''t vote that way as well.  Use some imagination.</td>', 'to everyone that doesn''t see the chrome...it''s a chrome gazing ball reflecting the ground.  Hope the dnmc people didn''t vote that way as well.  Use some imagination.', '2006-04-19 16:52:43.000000', NULL, 0),
