(2331068, 317979, 3724, '<td valign="top">I debated on this one...   originally voted five for sharpness but composition idea won out - 7... for strong composition.  I like the excellent crop....  Sharpen editing is so difficult for me, I don''t know what to tell you there, but on this foto with shallow dof, you may consider to open up a bit and keep in mind that your lens best sharpness is at f5.6.........  at least according to this.<br/><a href="//www.photozone.de/8Reviews/lenses/canon_60_28/index.htm" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">photozone - </a></td>', 'I debated on this one...   originally voted five for sharpness but composition idea won out - 7... for strong composition.  I like the excellent crop....  Sharpen editing is so difficult for me, I don''t know what to tell you there, but on this foto with shallow dof, you may consider to open up a bit and keep in mind that your lens best sharpness is at f5.6.........  at least according to this.photozone - ', '2006-04-20 22:53:14.000000', NULL, 0),
