(2334365, 318129, 49761, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by bob_bobski:</b></div><hr/><i> Is this the Scotty Cox bike from the "great biker build off" ?<br/>You couldn''t ask for more chrome, IMO a bit out of focus. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes..It is Scott''s bike..I had the pleasure of seeing it and him in the flesh, but with tooo many people pushing and shoving, the photo was not what i desired..</td>', 'Originally posted by bob_bobski: Is this the Scotty Cox bike from the "great biker build off" ?You couldn''t ask for more chrome, IMO a bit out of focus.   Yes..It is Scott''s bike..I had the pleasure of seeing it and him in the flesh, but with tooo many people pushing and shoving, the photo was not what i desired..', '2006-04-22 01:59:42.000000', NULL, 0),
