(2334395, 319993, 55917, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by puzzled:</b></div><hr/><i> This is a little hard for me to figure out. I like the title, but I wish I could see or understand where the chrome is. I try to not vote down for lack of meeting the challenge, in case I''m missing something that I should see. However, for the image itself, I am voting down a little because of the focus and other technicalities. The background would benefit from being much more out of focus, so the eye is drawn to focus on the bird. The bird is really cute. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you for your comments. I''m new to this digital camera and I appreciate your advice. I will take note and remember you on my next submission. Thank you.</td>', 'Originally posted by puzzled: This is a little hard for me to figure out. I like the title, but I wish I could see or understand where the chrome is. I try to not vote down for lack of meeting the challenge, in case I''m missing something that I should see. However, for the image itself, I am voting down a little because of the focus and other technicalities. The background would benefit from being much more out of focus, so the eye is drawn to focus on the bird. The bird is really cute.   Thank you for your comments. I''m new to this digital camera and I appreciate your advice. I will take note and remember you on my next submission. Thank you.', '2006-04-22 02:23:43.000000', NULL, 0),
