(2349731, 319687, 42125, '<td valign="top">I am really sorry for this. :-(<br/>I gave you "1" and I am a shamed for it.<br/>On a closer look I can see now that it is indeed a shining ball.<br/>And a very nice capture indeed.<br/>Thank you for teaching me a lesson. Too bad it had to cost you.<br/> <br/>You should have told me, I would have corrected my vote.<br/> <br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by sabphoto:</b></div><hr/><i> to everyone that doesn''t see the chrome...it''s a chrome gazing ball reflecting the ground.  Hope the dnmc people didn''t vote that way as well.  Use some imagination. </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'I am really sorry for this. :-(I gave you "1" and I am a shamed for it.On a closer look I can see now that it is indeed a shining ball.And a very nice capture indeed.Thank you for teaching me a lesson. Too bad it had to cost you. You should have told me, I would have corrected my vote. Originally posted by sabphoto: to everyone that doesn''t see the chrome...it''s a chrome gazing ball reflecting the ground.  Hope the dnmc people didn''t vote that way as well.  Use some imagination. ', '2006-04-27 07:22:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(2353097, 319147, 56307, '<td valign="top">First, thank you for your evaluation and comments!   Second, sorry for the delayed response.<br/> <br/>I see I have, unintentionally, upset people on here by saying I entered the challenge to test DPC.<br/>Most all that quoted me as saying that took it to be a negative thing to do. I also stated I wanted to see how helpful the others on this site would be to others(not  exact words). One would think that would be a good thing since the founders of this site said that was a main reason for this site (again, not exact words).  I am sorry for wanting to find out what this site is really, all about. Sorry for ruffling so many feathers, but Im not going to dwell on it.  I have receive many PM thanking me for my efforts and caring for others. Im not on here to win a little digital ribbon. All I want to do is help others get better, period. Is that wrong? Thirty, plus years experience in most all aspects of photography, and I want to share them to help others.  Am I sorry for wanting to help, NO!<br/> <br/>Thank you for your critique on my challenge, and I agree with your assessment. But you also took<br/>my comment  test DPC as a negative thing without regard to what I was looking for. It is clear to see I wanted to see how helpful to others this site is. You seem to care to want to help others and that is what I was looking for. You take a little extra effort to do so. So little can help so much!! Am I wrong for wanting to encourage  others to do the same?  <br/>Sorry others feel wanting to learn and help is such a negative thing to do<br/>Thank you!!</td>', 'First, thank you for your evaluation and comments!   Second, sorry for the delayed response. I see I have, unintentionally, upset people on here by saying I entered the challenge to test DPC.Most all that quoted me as saying that took it to be a negative thing to do. I also stated I wanted to see how helpful the others on this site would be to others(not  exact words). One would think that would be a good thing since the founders of this site said that was a main reason for this site (again, not exact words).  I am sorry for wanting to find out what this site is really, all about. Sorry for ruffling so many feathers, but Im not going to dwell on it.  I have receive many PM thanking me for my efforts and caring for others. Im not on here to win a little digital ribbon. All I want to do is help others get better, period. Is that wrong? Thirty, plus years experience in most all aspects of photography, and I want to share them to help others.  Am I sorry for wanting to help, NO! Thank you for your critique on my challenge, and I agree with your assessment. But you also tookmy comment  test DPC as a negative thing without regard to what I was looking for. It is clear to see I wanted to see how helpful to others this site is. You seem to care to want to help others and that is what I was looking for. You take a little extra effort to do so. So little can help so much!! Am I wrong for wanting to encourage  others to do the same?  Sorry others feel wanting to learn and help is such a negative thing to doThank you!!', '2006-04-28 11:26:43.000000', NULL, 0),
